<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Coles year net profit down 33.8 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Coles year net profit down 33.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 28</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				     280.4 vs 423.4</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     10.0 vs 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Coles Myer Ltd is Australia's biggest retail group.  </p>
